{"t":"Wyat","s":"wyat-c8cd3","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Wyat</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThais\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145837&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32325,32276,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32325, 32276, 7)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Officer</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5.2<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">March 17, 2000<br/>Beta 5.2</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221217071004&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wyat_f2da21.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Wyat.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais%20Jail\">Thais Jail</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>He's the sheriff of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais%20Jail\">Thaian Jail</a>.<br/>\nWyat is clearly an allusion to the legendary sheriff Wyatt Earp.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Wyat.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p><i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Wyat</strong>: Salutations, player! Speak quick, my {time} is limited.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nWyat: I am the {sheriff} of the Thaian territory.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>sheriff</b> or <b>time</b><br/>\nWyat: I uphold law and order. I protect Thais {inhabitants} ... and keep an eye on them.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>inhabitants</b><br/>\nWyat: Be more specific! If you want to talk about someone I'll need a name!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>god</b><br/>\nWyat: I am follower of Banor.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Banor</b><br/>\nWyat: He is the patron of justice and bravery.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Zathroth</b><br/>\nWyat: Don't mention this name!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>king</b><br/>\nWyat: HAIL TO KING TIBIANUS!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>mission</b> or <b>quest</b><br/>\nWyat: Look up our 'Tibia's most wanted' lists.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>weapon</b> or <b>armor</b> or <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Sam\">Sam</a></b><br/>\nWyat: <a href=\"#/wiki/Sam\">Sam</a>, the Thaian smith, is a man of great diligence. Whenever in need of weapons or armor, just ask him.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>castle</b><br/>\nWyat: <a href=\"#/wiki/Rain%20Castle\">The castle</a> should be relatively safe from criminal transgressions.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>army</b> or <b>guard</b><br/>\nWyat: I usually work with the townguards only.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>criminal</b><br/>\nWyat: Our enemies are numerous and not all are obvious.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>city</b><br/>\nWyat: <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">The city</a> is not as bad as some people might claim, but we certainly have our problems here.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>problems</b><br/>\nWyat: We will handle each problem with care.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>rebellion</b><br/>\nWyat: Luckily that's nothing I have to care about.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>general</b><br/>\nWyat: Old Bloodblade does a fine job.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Benjamin\">Benjamin</a></b><br/>\nWyat: The poor fool lost his mind some years ago. It's a good thing they gave him a job in the post office.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Bozo\">Bozo</a></b><br/>\nWyat: He's so funny, I could listen to his jokes for hours.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Chester%20Kahs\">Chester Kahs</a></b><br/>\nWyat: His bureau is at the northgate.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Eclesius\">Eclesius</a></b><br/>\nWyat: An old magician that lives south of here. I sometimes see strange smoke coming from his \nhouse.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Elane\">Elane</a></b><br/>\nWyat: A woman of great skill and courage. No one deserves the title of a Grandmaster of the Paladins more then her.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Gorn\">Gorn</a></b><br/>\nWyat: He was a rowdy in his youth, but now he's a fine citizen as far as I can tell.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Harsky\">Harsky</a></b> or <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Stutch\">Stutch</a></b><br/>\nWyat: A fine warrior, indeed. He is one of the king's bodyguards.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nWyat: LONG LIVE THE KING!</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Wyat</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":32325,"y":32276,"z":7}}